                        <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark">PBKDF2 Password Security</h6>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Managed through ASP.NET Core Identity. Plain-text passwords never touch persistence layers or audit logs.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 bg-white h-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="text-danger fs-3 mb-2"><i class="bi bi-lock"></i></div>
                        <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark">Automated Brute-Force Lockout</h6>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Accounts automatically lock for 15 minutes upon 5 consecutive failed login attempts to thwart credential stuffing.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 bg-white h-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="text-success fs-3 mb-2"><i class="bi bi-database-check"></i></div>
                        <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark">SQL Injection Immunity</h6>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Enforced through Entity Framework Core 8 parameterized query engine. Zero unparameterized SQL concatenation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 bg-white h-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="text-warning fs-3 mb-2"><i class="bi bi-patch-check"></i></div>
                        <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark">CSRF Anti-Forgery Defense</h6>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            All state-mutating requests mandate cryptographic anti-forgery request validation tokens.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

